sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Producer Transaction
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Outbox
    participant D as Dispatcher
    participant C as Consumer
    participant DLQ as Dead Letter Store

    P->>DB: BEGIN · domain state change<br/>+ INSERT event(event_id,aggregate_id,aggregate_seq,pending) · COMMIT
    Note over P,DB: State và event không thể commit lệch nhau.

    D->>DB: claim pending/expired event<br/>FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED, lease_token=T
    DB-->>D: event E, attempt n, aggregate_seq s
    D->>C: deliver E (at-least-once)

    C->>DB: BEGIN
    C->>DB: INSERT event_consumptions(event_id,consumer) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING
    alt duplicate consumption
        DB-->>C: 0 row
        C->>DB: COMMIT and return already_processed
    else first delivery
        C->>DB: lock consumer_checkpoint(aggregate_id)
        alt aggregate_seq = last_seq + 1
            C->>DB: apply idempotent side effect<br/>+ checkpoint last_seq=s + optional next outbox event
            C->>DB: COMMIT
        else aggregate_seq <= last_seq
            C->>DB: COMMIT and return stale_or_duplicate
        else aggregate_seq > last_seq + 1
            C->>DB: ROLLBACK and return sequence_gap
        end
    end

    alt success/already processed
        D->>DB: mark delivered WHERE lease_token=T
    else transient/sequence gap and attempt < max
        D->>DB: pending + exponential backoff + jitter<br/>last_error, next_attempt_at
    else permanent or attempts exhausted
        D->>DLQ: persist full payload + headers + error + versions
        D->>DB: mark dead and emit alert metric
    end

    Note over D,C: Delivery có thể lặp vật lý nhưng side effect logic chỉ xảy ra một lần.<br/>Ordering được bảo đảm theo aggregate, không giả định global order.
